<canvas id="c" width="360" height="640"></canvas>
<div id="lyr"><div id="l1"></div><div id="l2"></div></div>
<div id="adm" style="display: none;"><div class="card"><div class="tabs"><button class="tb" data-t="1">Events etc</button><button class="tb" data-t="2">Global chat</button><button class="tb on" data-t="3">Spawn</button></div>
<div id="t1" class="col" style="display: none;"><button class="ab" data-a="1">+1,000 coins</button><button class="ab" data-a="2">+1,000,000 coins</button><button class="ab" data-a="4" style="background:#8fd3ff;color:#06203a">❄️ Snow: ON (tap to stop)</button><button class="ab" data-a="5" style="background:#8fd3ff;color:#06203a">Stop all events</button><button class="ab" data-a="6" style="background:#6fa8ff;color:#06203a">🌧️ Rain: OFF (tap for 60s)</button><button class="ab" data-a="7" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6b6b,#ffd93d,#6bcB77,#4d96ff,#b36bff);color:#160d33">🌈 Rainbow: OFF (tap for 60s)</button><button class="ab" data-a="8" style="background:#ffb74d;color:#3a1c00">🌮 Raining tacos: OFF (tap for 60s)</button>
<p>Snap triggers these events (tap to toggle):</p><div class="tabs" id="snapEvTabs"><button class="tb" data-se="snow">❄️ Snow</button><button class="tb" data-se="rain">🌧️ Rain</button><button class="tb on" data-se="rainbow">🌈 Rainbow</button><button class="tb" data-se="tacos">🌮 Tacos</button></div>
